(HE4), 0.909 (ROMA) and 0.945 (RMI). CONCLUSION HE4 and ROMA helps differentiating OC from other pelvic masses, even in 
early stage OC. ROMA performs equally well as the ultrasound depending RMI and might be valuable as a first line 
