Stages‐II–IV OC and ovarian metastasis. Receiver–operating characteristics (ROC) curve analysis was used to evaluate the
diagnostic accuracy of the ADNEX model, with and without inclusion of CA\u2009125 level in the model.  Results Of the 
278 women included, 203 (73.0%) had a benign ovarian tumor and 75 (27.0%) had a malignant ovarian tumor, including 18 
