leiomyomas (18 cases; 9%). The specificity of CA125 for ovarian cancer increased with concentrations >1000 kU/litre. 
CONCLUSIONS These results confirm the high false positive rate and poor sensitivity and specificity associated with 
CA125. The substantial inappropriate usage of CA125 has led to results that are useless to the clinician, have cost 
