masses: external validation of the ADNEX model and comparison with other frequently used ultrasound methods\nAbstract: 
Objectives To validate externally the performance of the Assessment of Different NEoplasias in the adneXa (ADNEX) model 
and compare this model with other frequently used models in the differentiation between benign and malignant adnexal 
masses.  Methods In this retrospective diagnostic accuracy study, we assessed data collected prospectively from patients
with adnexal pathology who underwent real‐time transvaginal or transrectal ultrasound by a single expert 
