(simple rules), Logistic Regression model 2 (LR2) and the Risk of Malignancy Index (RMI), of which three different 
variants were assessed. Pathology was the clinical reference standard.  Results In total, 851 consecutive patients 
underwent ultrasound examination for an adnexal mass. For 326 patients (128 premenopausal and 198 postmenopausal), 
