0.93–0.98)) was superior to the ADNEX model (P\u2009=\u20090.01) in differentiating malignant from benign tumors. AUCs 
for the other models were 0.92 (95% CI, 0.89–0.95) for LR2, 0.85 (95% CI, 0.81–0.89) for RMI‐I, 0.82 (95% CI, 0.77–0.86)
