│ "title": "HE4, CA125 and risk of ovarian malignancy algorithm (ROMA) as diagnostic tools for ovarian cancer in       │
│ patients with a pelvic mass: an Italian multicenter study", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE This multicenter study aims to    │
│ evaluate HE4, CA125 and risk of ovarian malignancy algorithm (ROMA) performance in the differential diagnosis of     │
